{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33904","headline":"陪江西裴公游襄州延庆寺 · 皮日休","name":"陪江西裴公游襄州延庆寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹霄路上歇征轮，胜地偷闲一日身。\n不署前驱惊野鸟，唯将後乘载诗人。\n岩边候吏云遮却，竹下朝衣露滴新。\n更向碧山深处问，不妨犹有草茅臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}